WEBVTT

00:03.890 --> 00:07.860
So this is the island where the humans outside lived?

00:09.070 --> 00:10.820
It's in ruins.

00:11.280 --> 00:12.320
What's your game?

00:13.290 --> 00:15.320
Are you saying <i>this</i> is the world you came from?

00:17.490 --> 00:19.810
Ouni, cut it out! Ouni!

00:22.860 --> 00:26.170
You all truly know nothing.

00:31.530 --> 00:34.470
<i>We didn't know anything.</i>

00:34.930 --> 00:39.100
<i>Not a single thing about the world outside the Mud Whale.</i>

02:15.110 --> 02:16.690
What's this?

02:16.690 --> 02:17.550
A grave.

02:25.430 --> 02:27.680
<i>She had this many family and friends?</i>

02:28.520 --> 02:30.380
Did you bury them all yourself?

02:35.060 --> 02:37.720
All alone without giving a damn.

02:38.990 --> 02:40.130
You're a witch.

02:48.180 --> 02:52.090
<i>Why did so many people have to die?</i>

02:55.570 --> 02:58.960
<i>I'll pray for you, people I will never know.</i>

03:13.610 --> 03:14.090
Hey!

03:14.560 --> 03:16.220
Where are you leading us?

03:24.550 --> 03:25.710
Here.

03:40.450 --> 03:43.580
Hey, what is that? Answer me.

03:45.060 --> 03:46.120
Lykos?

03:46.990 --> 03:49.280
Lykos is not my name.

03:50.010 --> 03:52.790
It's the name of these creatures called nous.

03:52.790 --> 03:53.670
Creatures?

03:54.320 --> 03:57.640
Nous, the shape of a soul.

03:57.640 --> 04:00.580
They are creatures who feed on emotions.

04:01.590 --> 04:06.680
We offer our emotions to Lykos as nourishment.

04:07.170 --> 04:09.940
That is why our hearts are hollow.

04:11.910 --> 04:16.240
The people who discovered the nous entrusted their emotions to them.

04:16.900 --> 04:21.150
Emotions ruin the world. They are unnecessary.

04:22.520 --> 04:29.730
The outside world you longed to see is full of emotionless people making use of heartless Apathoia

04:29.730 --> 04:34.120
to wage a war that may never know an end.

04:34.970 --> 04:39.340
Can you find what you desire in a world like ours?

04:40.100 --> 04:41.860
Leave me and go.

04:42.380 --> 04:45.510
I'll stay here alone and die on this ship.

04:45.940 --> 04:47.510
Lykos...

04:47.510 --> 04:48.970
I don't care either way.

04:49.450 --> 04:54.940
Give me war or whatever else—
I've had enough of living trapped on the Mud Whale!

04:54.940 --> 04:59.150
If I can get away from there,
I'll give you all the emotions you want!

05:00.910 --> 05:03.030
Ouni, stop! It's dangerous!

05:06.630 --> 05:07.690
<i>What?</i>

05:12.750 --> 05:22.280
<i>Inside my head, I can see the contents of hundreds, thousands of unfamiliar hearts bubble up and disappear.</i>

05:28.090 --> 05:37.510
<i>Ah... This feeling, this chaos, is the sensation I
have when I'm unable to restrain my urge to write.</i>

05:39.120 --> 05:40.270
<i>Benihi?</i>

05:41.670 --> 05:43.900
<i>No, those are my memories...</i>

05:44.990 --> 05:46.240
<i>Stop!</i>

05:46.240 --> 05:49.200
<i>Even if they're sad, I don't want to forget!</i>

05:56.460 --> 05:57.370
Lykos...

06:07.320 --> 06:07.880
Hey!

06:08.380 --> 06:10.510
Do you understand what you've done?!

06:10.510 --> 06:12.850
Chakuro! Are you okay?

06:13.290 --> 06:15.830
Chakuro? Hey, Chakuro!

06:17.320 --> 06:18.060
Sami...

06:22.210 --> 06:24.570
You found a great many gravestones.

06:24.570 --> 06:26.840
Is that truly all you saw?

06:27.350 --> 06:28.190
Yes.

06:28.190 --> 06:29.350
Well, Chakuro?

06:29.350 --> 06:32.430
Yes, there was nothing else.

06:35.570 --> 06:38.820
Very well. I will believe your words.

06:39.960 --> 06:42.630
Taisha, relay this message.

06:42.980 --> 06:46.550
All passage to that island is expressly forbidden.

06:46.550 --> 06:48.260
What of the scavenging expedition?

06:48.260 --> 06:50.880
Not a single blade of grass is to be taken.

06:53.430 --> 06:55.750
Sit down and cool your head.

07:19.060 --> 07:21.080
Are you okay, Ouni?

07:21.080 --> 07:23.440
They didn't take your heart, right?

07:25.230 --> 07:28.970
When we were in there, I saw something strange.

07:28.970 --> 07:32.950
I wonder if that thing really does take hearts...

07:34.300 --> 07:35.810
For an instant...

07:36.480 --> 07:38.560
I saw it for just an instant.

07:39.060 --> 07:43.310
Is the war outside being waged with thymia?

07:44.170 --> 07:45.840
That woman was using it too.

07:45.840 --> 07:47.340
Ouni...

07:47.340 --> 07:50.610
Give it up. Didn't you see those graves?

07:50.610 --> 07:53.830
I'm a little bit scared of the outside world now.

07:55.090 --> 07:57.490
Hang on, why didn't you save me back then?!

07:57.490 --> 08:00.080
If Lykos hadn't saved me—

08:00.080 --> 08:00.790
Huh?

08:01.960 --> 08:04.710
<i>That is why our hearts are hollow.</i>

08:05.190 --> 08:08.370
But then, why did she help me?

08:08.980 --> 08:09.630
Chakuro.

08:10.810 --> 08:13.650
Masoo! I'll finish eating soon!

08:13.650 --> 08:15.340
It's fine, you're being released.

08:16.380 --> 08:17.630
But just you.

08:20.510 --> 08:24.600
Someone saw Ouni dragging you off by force.

08:24.600 --> 08:27.900
<i>I can't say it was totally against my will though...</i>

08:27.900 --> 08:30.180
You're lucky.

08:30.180 --> 08:32.200
This is the perfect time to get out.

08:32.200 --> 08:32.860
Huh?

08:35.530 --> 08:37.320
Chakuro!

08:37.860 --> 08:44.170
<i>On the Mud Whale, there exist a species of
large grasshoppers known as "star locusts".</i>

08:44.740 --> 08:48.890
<i>They survive off of the Mud Whale's waste products.</i>

08:49.670 --> 08:54.510
<i>Once their numbers reach a critical size, they metamorphose into a form better suited for long-distance travel</i>

08:54.510 --> 08:58.730
<i>and migrate into the night, emitting light as they fly.</i>

08:59.970 --> 09:04.980
<i>We call this phenomenon the "locust swarm".</i>

09:05.350 --> 09:08.730
Let's hurry! We need to find
a good spot before it gets dark.

09:08.730 --> 09:10.790
Yeah, yeah.

09:12.740 --> 09:15.200
Sami, Nezu, Rou!

09:15.200 --> 09:17.620
Please just give me a minute!

09:17.620 --> 09:19.430
Hey, Chakuro?

09:19.430 --> 09:21.130
Where are you going?

09:28.520 --> 09:29.460
Is something the matter?

09:29.990 --> 09:31.980
Do your injuries still hurt?

09:34.600 --> 09:39.170
I have the honor of serving all of the Elders' needs in this tower.

09:39.170 --> 09:40.680
My name is Neri.

09:40.680 --> 09:44.760
I may only be an Unmarked, but please do not hesitate to request my assistance.

09:45.910 --> 09:47.730
Tell something to the Elders.

09:48.230 --> 09:53.980
I can't live without that ship. Return me to Lykos.

09:54.350 --> 09:56.690
I shouldn't leave their side.

09:57.700 --> 09:59.910
Having emotions...

10:00.660 --> 10:02.490
would be unbearable.

10:03.800 --> 10:05.880
I need them to erase my heart.

10:07.060 --> 10:09.400
It's normal to have a heart.

10:10.660 --> 10:12.550
You'll grow accustomed to it soon.

10:17.520 --> 10:18.470
Found you!

10:18.470 --> 10:19.590
Chakuro?

10:19.590 --> 10:22.680
Neri, I need a favor! Can I take Lykos out of here?

10:23.010 --> 10:24.670
Take her out?

10:24.670 --> 10:26.640
Do you want to be sent to the bowels again?

10:27.170 --> 10:29.150
I want to see the locust swarm together.

10:29.150 --> 10:31.730
With Lykos and my other friends.

10:33.020 --> 10:34.980
Thanks a lot!

10:37.410 --> 10:40.240
You should find a nice, high spot too, Neri!

10:42.910 --> 10:43.780
Let me go.

10:43.780 --> 10:44.240
No.

10:44.750 --> 10:47.990
Even if you're heartless, I can't just ignore you.

10:48.510 --> 10:52.630
You dug all those graves for your companions by yourself.

10:53.250 --> 10:55.670
How could I possibly leave someone like that alone?!

11:03.710 --> 11:05.600
What?! With Lykos?

11:05.600 --> 11:06.770
The island girl?

11:06.770 --> 11:08.290
For real?!

11:10.410 --> 11:13.660
H-Hi! My name's Nezu.

11:14.460 --> 11:15.940
So what now?

11:16.370 --> 11:19.990
If someone finds out, missing the
swarm'll be the least of your problems.

11:19.990 --> 11:20.950
It'll be fine!

11:21.430 --> 11:25.990
If I put my sand mantle on her, nobody can tell who she is.

11:27.550 --> 11:32.190
Nice job throwing your dirty, smelly mantle right on top of a girl's head.

11:32.880 --> 11:34.400
Wait, give it back!

11:34.400 --> 11:36.860
No, but then you'll be spotted!

11:38.770 --> 11:41.110
The top of the fourth tower looks free.

11:41.110 --> 11:42.090
Let's head up.

11:51.140 --> 11:53.350
Augh, I can't go on!

11:53.350 --> 11:54.670
I'm pooped!

11:54.670 --> 11:56.300
We're almost at the top.

11:56.300 --> 11:57.690
But...

11:58.010 --> 11:59.400
You can do it.

12:00.000 --> 12:01.150
Chakuro.

12:02.020 --> 12:03.700
Carry me.

12:05.410 --> 12:07.370
Wh-What are you saying?

12:07.370 --> 12:09.290
You carried me last time!

12:09.750 --> 12:13.220
Wasn't the last locust swarm three years ago?

12:09.770 --> 12:10.990
Last time?

12:10.990 --> 12:14.000
Carry me! I can't walk anymore!

12:13.220 --> 12:14.000
Yeah.

12:14.000 --> 12:17.250
I can't! You're too heavy now!

12:19.140 --> 12:21.270
I am <i>not</i> heavy!

12:21.270 --> 12:24.160
You're a meanie, Chakuro! Dummy! Cheapo!

12:26.470 --> 12:28.410
See? You can still walk.

12:31.000 --> 12:32.930
Sami, are you all right?

12:34.470 --> 12:35.910
Want a piggyback ride?

12:39.370 --> 12:40.540
I'm fine.

12:44.280 --> 12:47.300
Mommy, where are the locusts?

12:48.150 --> 12:49.200
They'll come soon.

12:49.530 --> 12:52.210
Can you hang in there a little longer?

12:53.680 --> 12:54.920
Upsa-daisy.

12:54.920 --> 12:57.090
Now we'll get there in a jiff.

12:57.090 --> 12:59.580
Masoo, I'm so sorry.

12:59.580 --> 13:00.630
Don't worry about it!

13:01.070 --> 13:05.220
I lost my own kid in an accident in the sand ocean.

13:05.220 --> 13:07.720
But I love caring for small children.

13:09.890 --> 13:13.390
Excuse me, Kuchiba. That hurts.

13:13.800 --> 13:16.460
You're grasping my hand too tightly.

13:16.460 --> 13:17.600
I-I'm so sorry!

13:24.840 --> 13:25.890
What is it?

13:27.180 --> 13:28.170
I saw it.

13:28.170 --> 13:29.620
A locust? Where?

13:32.030 --> 13:37.170
I was enrolled in a military prep academy when I was seven.

13:38.070 --> 13:41.500
My family was taking me to the school barracks.

13:42.630 --> 13:51.260
That was to be the last day I saw them, but devoid of emotions as we were, I had no strong feelings about it.

13:52.370 --> 13:56.620
The road to the barracks was long and rugged,
and our bags were heavy.

13:57.230 --> 13:58.730
Stand up.

14:00.140 --> 14:02.570
Otherwise you will never become a proper soldier.

14:33.680 --> 14:34.680
I saw that!

14:35.020 --> 14:39.430
I saw the you from back then
when I was inside that creature!

14:43.070 --> 14:46.820
I never... gave it a second thought before.

14:48.920 --> 14:53.110
So why... does it hurt so much now?

14:56.880 --> 14:57.660
Lykos.

14:58.030 --> 15:01.000
You really do have a heart.

15:03.420 --> 15:04.580
We're the same.

15:05.310 --> 15:07.050
You and I are the same.

15:09.250 --> 15:15.510
You know, one day the Mud Whale
might make it to where your family is.

15:16.500 --> 15:21.690
And on the Mud Whale, there's no need to be a soldier or fight or die.

15:22.010 --> 15:24.610
Lykos, live with us here.

15:27.940 --> 15:28.930
Chakuro.

15:29.990 --> 15:30.650
Yeah?

15:31.600 --> 15:36.620
There's something I have to tell you all.

15:37.620 --> 15:38.580
This ship...

15:38.580 --> 15:39.870
Look!

15:44.730 --> 15:45.880
Falaina is...

16:03.150 --> 16:06.450
I wonder where they're going.

16:09.750 --> 16:13.410
We wanna go to some faraway land too!

16:13.740 --> 16:19.240
<i>93 Sand Era, eighth day of the seventh month. The locust swarm phenomenon occurred.</i>

16:20.260 --> 16:24.150
<i>The swarm flew above the Mud Whale
in a shower of light,</i>

16:24.150 --> 16:28.200
<i>departing for the sand ocean only at the first rays of dawn. </i>

16:35.050 --> 16:37.010
Chakuro!

16:37.010 --> 16:39.570
Get up already! Breakfast time!

16:42.810 --> 16:46.020
Oh, come on! Get your act together!

16:46.380 --> 16:49.020
I've had it up to here with being in the same group as you!

16:49.020 --> 16:53.480
All you do is cause me trouble, you damn destroyer.

16:53.480 --> 16:56.110
Tobi, just to remind you...

16:56.920 --> 17:02.370
Ever since our parents died and we started living under the same roof,

17:02.990 --> 17:07.210
I've been looking after your younger siblings.

17:08.000 --> 17:10.920
Don't you think we're even?

17:11.880 --> 17:14.320
Chakuro, you spilled!

17:14.320 --> 17:16.510
<i>You're</i> the one being looked after...

17:16.510 --> 17:17.640
How the hell is this even?!

17:17.640 --> 17:19.800
I'm on farm duty today!

17:19.800 --> 17:21.470
See you later!

17:23.960 --> 17:24.950
Suou!

17:26.630 --> 17:28.610
Big brother!

17:29.750 --> 17:31.630
You're all covered in dirt.

17:31.630 --> 17:36.530
I was already a bit behind,
so I came here early to catch up.

17:36.530 --> 17:37.370
Hup!

17:38.170 --> 17:38.780
Huh?

17:38.780 --> 17:43.540
Sometimes it really hurts to think about how bad he is at physical labor.

17:44.820 --> 17:46.500
How about we plant the seeds?

17:48.480 --> 17:51.030
Wasn't the locust swarm yesterday pretty?

17:51.030 --> 17:51.670
Yeah.

17:52.230 --> 17:54.880
Where did you go with Lykos after?

17:54.880 --> 17:56.810
I brought her back to the central tower.

17:57.390 --> 17:59.050
I had to sneak her out in the first place.

18:00.180 --> 18:01.260
Oh.

18:05.750 --> 18:07.190
Sami! Chakuro!

18:07.510 --> 18:08.820
Please finish the rest!

18:09.420 --> 18:12.060
I have to go help the Council of Elders!

18:12.060 --> 18:13.070
Okay!

18:16.150 --> 18:17.800
S-Sorry!

18:17.800 --> 18:18.610
It's okay.

18:27.370 --> 18:28.360
Neri?

18:29.000 --> 18:30.580
Suou.

18:30.580 --> 18:32.150
What's wrong?

18:32.150 --> 18:36.470
Well, Lykos said she needed to speak with the Elders.

18:36.990 --> 18:39.540
She looked quite distressed.

18:39.540 --> 18:43.640
Despite that, the Council refused her an audience.

18:45.870 --> 18:53.660
The truth is, the Council sent a squad out to sea to surveil the surroundings without telling Lady Taisha.

18:56.290 --> 18:58.550
I'll meet with her instead.

18:58.550 --> 18:59.950
You cannot!

18:59.950 --> 19:02.990
I was told not to allow anyone past, and they even posted a guard!

19:05.380 --> 19:07.240
Do you have business here?

19:07.240 --> 19:08.900
I can't let you inside.

19:08.900 --> 19:10.460
I have permission to enter.

19:10.460 --> 19:12.510
I-I've heard nothing about—

19:14.200 --> 19:16.960
And now you have. Okay?

19:21.470 --> 19:23.140
Pardon me. I am—

19:23.140 --> 19:26.220
Please, let me speak with one of the leaders of this island!

19:26.220 --> 19:29.600
There is something important I must tell them.

19:31.900 --> 19:33.110
Please tell me.

19:37.780 --> 19:38.930
Lady Taisha.

19:39.660 --> 19:42.280
Chakuro's logs flew away.

19:42.280 --> 19:43.780
We need to retrieve them.

19:43.780 --> 19:45.280
I'll send someone else to do it.

19:47.340 --> 19:51.750
He told us that he leaves records because he wants to know more about the world.

19:52.640 --> 19:54.980
I currently feel the same way he does.

19:55.780 --> 19:57.130
And yet...

19:57.130 --> 20:02.670
The Council of Elders is attempting to keep the driftland girl from us.

20:02.670 --> 20:04.050
There is nothing that can be done.

20:04.490 --> 20:08.740
It is our custom that the Council of Elders has full control over the Mud Whale.

20:08.740 --> 20:11.390
Yes, I understand that.

20:13.060 --> 20:18.680
All Unmarked are inducted into the Council of Elders
once they reach the age of sixty-one.

20:18.680 --> 20:24.410
It is only then that we are informed about the
Mud Whale's history and its connection to the world.

20:24.910 --> 20:31.410
The Chieftain has no real political pull, and serves only to be an object of affection for the citizens.

20:31.850 --> 20:35.330
Nineteen years still stand between me and the Council.

20:35.860 --> 20:42.490
Until then, I must act the perfect idol,
my limbs dangling from strings like a puppet.

20:42.490 --> 20:44.890
Wh-What is wrong with that?

20:44.890 --> 20:48.470
Whether you are a puppet or anything else, I—

20:49.840 --> 20:52.070
I will always support you!

20:56.500 --> 20:59.150
For the sake of the Mud Whale...

21:00.210 --> 21:02.310
I shall be a good puppet.

21:09.730 --> 21:11.200
What's that?

21:13.130 --> 21:16.180
Skylos, beginning mission.

21:16.850 --> 21:19.430
You have to escape from here as soon as possible!

21:19.430 --> 21:20.380
This island...

21:20.830 --> 21:21.950
Falaina is...

21:24.420 --> 21:27.290
Chakuro, do you think that's a sand dolphin?

21:27.290 --> 21:27.800
Huh?

21:30.620 --> 21:31.680
All of you...

21:34.860 --> 21:38.980
The sinners of Falaina are under pursuit.

21:39.330 --> 21:41.480
Sinners? We are?

21:53.040 --> 21:53.750
<i>That day,</i>

21:55.400 --> 22:00.340
<i>I wrote my final official record as archivist.</i>

22:01.700 --> 22:06.800
<i>All further records of the events regarding the Mud Whale</i>

22:08.180 --> 22:09.180
<i>are my personal diary.</i>
